    <field_description order="before"><para>Controls the Physical Interrupt Domain that PPI &lt;(n * 32) + x&gt; is assigned to.</para>
<para>If the physical PPI is assigned to an unimplemented Interrupt Domain, all of the following are true:</para>
<list type="unordered">
<listitem><content>The physical PPI is not selected as the candidate HPPI in any Interrupt Domain.</content>
</listitem><listitem><content>Access to the state and configuration of the PPI using an ICC_PPI_ System register is only permitted at EL3.</content>
</listitem><listitem><content>Attempts to deactivate the PPI by executing a GIC xDDI System instruction are treated as NOPs.</content>
</listitem></list></field_description>
